(test-only), no consent checked.

## Computed style (live DOM)

label: "Konfirmasi ikut pesanan"
disabled: true
computed cursor: "not-allowed"
computed backgroundColor: "rgb(234, 232, 227)"  (wesup-paper-sub)
computed opacity: "1"
hint present: "Centang persetujuan syarat di atas untuk mengaktifkan tombol konfirmasi."

The button uses the disabled recipe (bg-wesup-paper-sub + text-wesup-ink-sub +
cursor-not-allowed) instead of relying on opacity alone, so the disabled state is
readable and the reason is stated next to it.

